      "A highly technical 3D architectural diagram of a cloud infrastructure with glowing blue nodes and thin digital connection lines. The style is hyper-clean, minimal, and industrial, set against a pristine white background with soft shadows. Precision and scalability are the main themes, using a color palette of navy, electric blue, and white.",
