      "An intricate technical blueprint of a high-performance computer chip with glowing microcircuits and silicon pathways. The aesthetic is clean-room industrial minimalism, featuring a monochromatic silver and white palette with sharp cyan highlights. The lighting is cold and precise, emphasizing the technological complexity and reliability of the hardware design.",
