      "A futuristic laboratory console with multiple floating translucent screens displaying real-time data visualizations and complex algorithms. The scene is illuminated by the soft glow of glassmorphic panels and high-tech blue status indicators. The environment is impeccably clean and reflects high-end industrial engineering standards with a focus on data security and precision.",
