      "A minimalist data center interior with rows of sleek, matte black server racks under cool white neon strip lighting. The perspective is a low-angle symmetrical shot that highlights the vastness and precision of the facility. The floor is a polished concrete that reflects the technical glow of the hardware, creating a mood of absolute stability and power.",
