      "A macro photograph of high-precision electronic components within a solar inverter. Focus is on SiC MOSFET power modules mounted on a polished copper heatsink with subtle blue liquid cooling pipes. The lighting is cold and clinical, emphasizing the silver and metallic textures of the circuitry. The image suggests cutting-edge power electronics and high-end industrial engineering.",
