      "A professional headshot of a senior software engineer in a high-tech lab setting. The subject is wearing a clean, dark polo shirt, looking confident and approachable. The background is slightly blurred, showing technical equipment and subtle blue LED indicators, reflecting a cold, precise industrial aesthetic consistent with the KnowledgeCenter brand.",
      "w-24 h-24 rounded-full mb-4 object-cover border-2 border-primary-fixed",
