      "isolation:",
      "hardware_enclave",
      "heartbeat:",
      "enabled",
      "architectures",
      "Asymmetric Distribution Models",
      "The solution lies in localized compute cells. Instead of centralized data centers, we are seeing the rise of \"micro-fabrics\" integrated directly into the factory floor. These nodes use specialized hardware accelerators—TPUs and FPGAs—to handle inference and control logic locally.",
      "border-l-4 border-primary pl-8 py-4 my-10 bg-surface-container-low italic text-headline-md font-headline-md text-on-secondary-fixed",
      "\"Reliability at the edge is not an optimization; it is the fundamental requirement for the next industrial revolution.\"",
      "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBHnAfRnAA-YKqFn5IEXHitak6K7x79XLNRw3WzCpI8krH8-qjlmwwce4-jIq5faJjmQYXjj2GIBS_VMHNvy117J6jgKiPrBTEvwQOUwusEP2dBCH03gv-fMrmWy5JCsa7omv0UvPCmVf0dMYkPBoTceL-fowhr-cjE14uO7WIPsUK1eLnJDXJKl4AQBhUjeVYMrLwak3I7MbgxayL-lDOCXg7cAXZlbQTByqJy8TRd1GWpJjz0RIUsfJ-TmWUEGK9GZT9WtFyizts",
      "A clean, minimalist technical diagram showing a network of interconnected edge computing nodes represented by glowing geometric icons. The diagram is styled with thin, precise lines and a limited palette of white, black, and electric blue on a light gray background. It conveys the concept of distributed intelligence and synchronized industrial control with architectural clarity and high-tech elegance.",
      "w-full h-80 object-cover rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 my-stack-lg",
      "By offloading the critical decision-making path to these deterministic nodes, we reduce the blast radius of network failures and ensure that physical safety protocols are executed within nanoseconds of an anomaly detection.",
      "mt-stack-lg pt-stack-md border-t border-outline-variant/30 flex justify-between items-center",
